      <section class="lp-faq" id="faq" aria-label="Često postavljana pitanja">
        <div class="lp-faq__inner">
          <h2 class="lp-faq__title stitle2 reveal-on-scroll">Često postavljana pitanja</h2>

          <p class="lp-faq__subtitle">Imate pitanja? Imamo odgovore.</p>
          <div class="lp-faq__list" data-sp-faq-list>
            <article class="lp-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="lp-faq__question" id="lp-faq-question-1"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="lp-faq-answer-1"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="lp-faq__question-text stexts2">Podržavaju li bolni plantarni fasciitis?</span>
                <span class="lp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="lp-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="lp-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="lp-faq__answer" id="lp-faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-question-1" inert>
                <div class="lp-faq__answer-inner"><div class="lp-faq__answer-content stext2">Konturirani luk smanjuje napetost preko plantarne fascije, dok amortizacija pete omekšava svaki doskok. Dosljedna potpora može učiniti jutarnje šetnje i kretanje lakšim.</div></div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="lp-faq__question" id="lp-faq-question-2"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="lp-faq-answer-2"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="lp-faq__question-text stexts2">Zašto je potpora luka važna u ovoj cipeli?</span>
                <span class="lp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="lp-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="lp-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="lp-faq__answer" id="lp-faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-question-2" inert>
                <div class="lp-faq__answer-inner"><div class="lp-faq__answer-content stext2">Stabilna lučna platforma vodi stopalo prema zdravijem položaju i raspoređuje težinu po širokoj površini. To smanjuje naprezanje ispod pete i sredine stopala dok pomaže gležnju i koljenu u prirodnom smjeru.</div></div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="lp-faq__question" id="lp-faq-question-3"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="lp-faq-answer-3"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="lp-faq__question-text stexts2">Jesu li mekani ili čvrsti?</span>
                <span class="lp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="lp-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="lp-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="lp-faq__answer" id="lp-faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-question-3" inert>
                <div class="lp-faq__answer-inner"><div class="lp-faq__answer-content stext2">Oni kombiniraju amortizaciju sa strukturom umjesto da se oslanjaju samo na mekoću. Podloga je udobna, dok luk i peta usmjeravaju poravnanje i kontroliraju pritisak tijekom hodanja.</div></div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="lp-faq__question" id="lp-faq-question-4"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="lp-faq-answer-4"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="lp-faq__question-text stexts2">Mogu li ih nositi tijekom bolnog pogoršanja?</span>
                <span class="lp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="lp-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="lp-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="lp-faq__answer" id="lp-faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-question-4" inert>
                <div class="lp-faq__answer-inner"><div class="lp-faq__answer-content stext2">Potporna obuća može pomoći kada se simptomi pojačaju jer bosonogo hodanje i ravne cipele dodatno opterećuju. Započnite s kratkim razdobljima i potražite stručnu pomoć ako je bol jaka, iznenadna ili se s vremenom pogoršava.</div></div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="lp-faq__question" id="lp-faq-question-5"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="lp-faq-answer-5"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="lp-faq__question-text stexts2">Kada bi bol u plantarnoj fasciji trebala početi popuštati?</span>
                <span class="lp-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="lp-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="lp-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="lp-faq__answer" id="lp-faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="lp-faq-question-5" inert>
                <div class="lp-faq__answer-inner"><div class="lp-faq__answer-content stext2">Neki ljudi odmah primjećuju bolju potporu, dok nadraženom tkivu treba više vremena. Nosite cipele redovito, postupno ih povećavajte i zapamtite da oporavak ovisi o težini i aktivnosti tijekom vremena.</div></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
                
